hering you?"}, {"start": 14.5, "end": 14.9, "text": "Nothing."}, {"start": 15.26, "end": 16.381, "text": "I feel fine."}, {"start": 17.261, "end": 17.541, "text": "Good."}, {"start": 18.582, "end": 21.343, "text": "We have your fasting blood glucose result."}, {"start": 22.343, "end": 22.843, "text": "Go ahead."}, {"start": 23.704, "end": 27.625, "text": "It is 6.2 millimoles per liter."}, {"start": 28.606, "end": 28.906, "text": "Is that"}, {"start": 29.298, "end": 30.779, "text": "Outside the normal range?"}, {"start": 31.88, "end": 33.561, "text": "It is slightly raised."}, {"start": 34.662, "end": 35.142, "text": "Slightly."}, {"start": 35.682, "end": 36.583, "text": "Not badly, then."}, {"start": 37.484, "end": 37.944, "text": "Correct."}, {"start": 38.744, "end": 40.726, "text": "It is a mild elevation."}, {"start": 41.826, "end": 43.428, "text": "What does that mean in practice?"}, {"start": 44.588, "end": 47.991, "text": "It means we should consider pre-diabetes."}, {"start": 49.652, "end": 50.372, "text": "Consider it."}, {"start": 50.913, "end": 52.814, "text": "So it is not a diagnosis yet."}, {"start": 53.975, "end": 54.235, "text": "No."}, {"start": 55.095, "end": 57.117, "text": "It is something to keep in mind."}, {"start": 58.298, "end": 58.818, "text": "Understood."}, {"start": 59.55, "end": 60.531, "text": "So what do we do?"}, {"start": 61.812, "end": 63.553, "text": "I recommend monitoring."}, {"start": 64.634, "end": 66.095, "text": "Keeping an eye on the glucose."}, {"start": 67.136, "end": 68.978, "text": "Yes, exactly that."}, {"start": 70.099, "end": 71.22, "text": "That seems reasonable."}, {"start": 71.9, "end": 73.281, "text": "Nothing else changes today?"}, {"start": 74.342, "end": 75.944, "text": "Monitoring is the plan."}, {"start": 77.044, "end": 77.345, "text": "Good."}, {"start": 78.205, "end": 80.147, "text": "Have you seen the forecast for the weekend?"}, {"start": 81.188, "end": 82.289, "text": "Dry, I believe."}, {"start": 82.969, "end": 84.391, "text": "Better than last weekend."}, {"start": 85.451, "end": 86.032, "text": "That helps."}, {"start": 86.672, "end": 88.474, "text": "I have a long weekend coming up."}, {"start": 89.499, "end": 90.486, "text": "Make the most of it."}, {"start": 91.251, "end": 92.44, "text": "Take care, Casper."}], "machine": "gpu59.int.triton.aalto.fi", "git_commit": "735eed3a1a4f5d8bc8a3ac1f1c8897e291443b9f", "date": "2026-09-20", "timing_s": {"transcribe_and_align": 1.579}}